) VALUES
('AlperPro 4-Valve Brass Manifold Gauge Set R410A R22 R404A','TL-GA-MAN4-410','TL-GA-MAN4-410','AlperPro','accessory','gauges',89.00,'A four-valve brass manifold designed for R-410A pressures, with dual low-side and high-side ports so a technician can pull vacuum and charge without breaking connections. The forged brass body carries a 800 psi high-side and 250 psi low-side working range with a 4,000 psi burst rating, and the 2.5 in class 1.0 gauges are dampened for readable needles on a running system. Sight glass in the manifold body shows liquid flow during charging. Supplied with three 60 in 1/4 in SAE charging hoses rated 800 psi working pressure and fitted with ball-valve depressors, plus a hanging hook and moulded case. Scales are printed for R-410A, R-22 and R-404A so it covers the great majority of residential and light commercial service calls. Sold to HVAC contractors, service fleets and training programs; case and pallet pricing available.','{"Type":"4-valve brass manifold gauge set","Refrigerant Scales":"R-410A, R-22, R-404A","High Side Range":"0 to 800 psi","Low Side Range":"0 to 250 psi","Burst Pressure":"4,000 psi","Gauge Size":"2.5 in, class 1.0","Hoses":"3 x 60 in, 1/4 in SAE, 800 psi","Body":"Forged brass with sight glass"}','["4-valve manifold","3 charging hoses","Ball-valve hose depressors","Hanging hook","Moulded carry case"]','["Residential service","Light commercial service","Recharging","Evacuation","Diagnostics"]','Hardware > Tools > Measuring Tools & Sensors','new','in_stock',120,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-MAN4-410.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-MAN4-410.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-MAN4-410-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro Digital Manifold Gauge Set with Bluetooth and Probes','TL-GA-DIG-BT','TL-GA-DIG-BT','AlperPro','accessory','gauges',279.00,'A digital manifold that replaces analogue gauges with two 0 to 800 psi pressure transducers, two clamp-on temperature probes and a live superheat and subcooling readout, so charging decisions are made from calculated values rather than a pressure chart. More than eighty refrigerant profiles are stored on board, including R-410A, R-32, R-454B, R-134a, R-404A and R-407C, and the unit reports target subcooling against the manufacturer table. Bluetooth pairing streams a session log to a phone so readings can be attached to a service ticket or commissioning report. The housing is rubber-armoured with IP54 sealing, magnetic hook and rechargeable battery rated about 25 hours per charge. Included are two 60 in hoses, two pipe clamp thermocouples, USB-C charging cable and a hard case. Volume pricing for service fleets and distributors.','{"Type":"Digital manifold gauge set","Pressure Range":"0 to 800 psi, both sides","Accuracy":"Plus or minus 0.5 percent full scale","Refrigerant Profiles":"80 plus including R-454B, R-32, R-410A","Temperature Probes":"2 clamp-on thermocouples","Readouts":"Superheat, subcooling, target subcool, vacuum","Connectivity":"Bluetooth session logging","Rating":"IP54, rechargeable battery approx 25 h"}','["Digital manifold","2 pressure hoses","2 clamp temperature probes","USB-C cable","Hard carry case"]','["Commissioning","System charging","Fault diagnosis","Service documentation","Training"]','Hardware > Tools > Measuring Tools & Sensors','new','in_stock',60,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-DIG-BT.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-DIG-BT.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-DIG-BT-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro 2-Valve Manifold Gauge Set R134a Automotive','TL-GA-MAN2-134','TL-GA-MAN2-134','AlperPro','accessory','gauges',59.00,'A two-valve manifold set scaled for R-134a automotive air conditioning work, with quick-couplers that snap onto the low and high side service ports used on passenger vehicles and light trucks. The high-side gauge reads to 500 psi and the low-side compound gauge reads vacuum to 250 psi, both with colour-coded dials and shock-resistant lenses. Hoses are 72 in, long enough to reach across an engine bay while the manifold hangs from the hood. The aluminium body keeps the assembly light for mobile technicians who carry it all day. This set is intended for R-134a service only; R-1234yf systems require dedicated equipment and couplers, and mixing service equipment between the two refrigerants is prohibited. Sold to repair shops, fleet workshops and mobile technicians, with case pricing for multi-bay operations.','{"Type":"2-valve manifold gauge set","Refrigerant":"R-134a","High Side Range":"0 to 500 psi","Low Side Range":"30 in Hg vacuum to 250 psi","Couplers":"Automotive quick-couplers, low and high side","Hoses":"2 x 72 in","Body":"Anodised aluminium"}','["2-valve manifold","2 charging hoses","Low and high side quick-couplers","Carry case"]','["Automotive AC service","Fleet maintenance","Mobile repair","Diagnostics"]','Hardware > Tools > Measuring Tools & Sensors','new','in_stock',140,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-MAN2-134.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-MAN2-134.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-MAN2-134-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro Wireless Digital Vacuum Micron Gauge','TL-GA-MICRON','TL-GA-MICRON','AlperPro','accessory','gauges',139.00,'A vacuum gauge that reads from atmospheric pressure down to 10 microns, which is the only reliable way to confirm a system has been evacuated properly before charging. The thermistor sensor is field-cleanable, an important detail because oil contamination is the usual reason cheap micron gauges start reading falsely low. A programmable target alarm sounds when the system reaches setpoint, and the decay-test mode holds and graphs pressure rise after the pump is isolated so a technician can distinguish trapped moisture from a genuine leak. Bluetooth pairing lets the reading be watched from the truck while the pump runs. Housing is impact-resistant with a magnetic base and 1/4 in SAE swivel connection. Ships with a 1/4 in tee adapter and batteries. Trade pricing by case and pallet.','{"Type":"Digital vacuum micron gauge","Range":"10 to 25,000 microns","Sensor":"Field-cleanable thermistor","Accuracy":"Plus or minus 10 percent of reading","Connection":"1/4 in SAE swivel","Features":"Target alarm, decay test, Bluetooth","Power":"AA batteries"}','["Micron gauge","1/4 in tee adapter","Batteries","Protective boot"]','["Evacuation verification","Leak decay testing","Commissioning","Warranty documentation"]','Hardware > Tools > Measuring Tools & Sensors','new','in_stock',100,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-MICRON.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-MICRON.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-GA-MICRON-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro 5 CFM Two-Stage Refrigerant Vacuum Pump','TL-TO-VAC-5CFM','TL-TO-VAC-5CFM','AlperPro','accessory','tools',189.00,'A two-stage rotary-vane vacuum pump rated 5 CFM with an ultimate vacuum of 15 microns, sized for residential split systems, mini-splits and light commercial work up to roughly five tons. Two stages matter: a single-stage pump stalls in the range where water actually boils out of a system, while a two-stage pump keeps pulling to a deep vacuum so moisture leaves instead of staying behind to form acid. The 1/2 HP motor starts under load at low ambient temperature, and the isolation valve at the inlet lets the pump be shut off for a decay test without losing vacuum. An oil sight glass and bottom drain make oil changes quick, which is the single biggest factor in pump life. Supplied with 1/4 in and 3/8 in SAE inlet fittings, one bottle of vacuum pump oil and a carry handle.','{"Type":"Two-stage rotary vane vacuum pump","Free Air Displacement":"5 CFM","Ultimate Vacuum":"15 microns","Motor":"1/2 HP, 115V 60Hz","Inlet":"1/4 in and 3/8 in SAE","Oil Capacity":"370 ml","Features":"Inlet isolation valve, sight glass, bottom drain","Weight":"Approx 11 kg"}','["Vacuum pump","1/4 in and 3/8 in SAE adapters","Bottle of vacuum pump oil","Operating manual"]','["Residential evacuation","Mini-split commissioning","Light commercial service","Moisture removal"]','Hardware > Tools','new','in_stock',80,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-VAC-5CFM.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-VAC-5CFM.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-VAC-5CFM-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro 8 CFM Two-Stage Refrigerant Vacuum Pump','TL-TO-VAC-8CFM','TL-TO-VAC-8CFM','AlperPro','accessory','tools',259.00,'An 8 CFM two-stage vacuum pump for larger jobs: multi-zone systems, rooftop units, long line-set runs and commercial refrigeration racks where a 5 CFM pump would take hours to reach target. Ultimate vacuum is 15 microns, the motor is 1 HP and the large-bore 3/8 in inlet reduces the restriction that usually limits real-world pumping speed more than the pump itself. Included are 1/4 in and 3/8 in SAE fittings and an inlet isolation valve for decay testing. The cast aluminium housing and thermally protected motor tolerate long continuous runs on hot roofs, and the oil sight glass plus bottom drain keep servicing simple between calls. Recommended pairing is a micron gauge on the system rather than at the pump, and 3/8 in evacuation hoses instead of standard charging hoses.','{"Type":"Two-stage rotary vane vacuum pump","Free Air Displacement":"8 CFM","Ultimate Vacuum":"15 microns","Motor":"1 HP, 115V 60Hz, thermally protected","Inlet":"1/4 in and 3/8 in SAE","Oil Capacity":"600 ml","Features":"Inlet isolation valve, sight glass, bottom drain","Weight":"Approx 15 kg"}','["Vacuum pump","1/4 in and 3/8 in SAE adapters","Bottle of vacuum pump oil","Operating manual"]','["Commercial evacuation","Rooftop units","Multi-zone systems","Refrigeration racks"]','Hardware > Tools','new','in_stock',60,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-VAC-8CFM.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-VAC-8CFM.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-VAC-8CFM-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro 1 HP Refrigerant Recovery Machine 115V','TL-RE-REC-1HP','TL-RE-REC-1HP','AlperPro','accessory','recovery',429.00,'A 1 HP oil-less recovery machine for pulling refrigerant out of a system into a DOT recovery cylinder, which federal rules require before opening any circuit for service or disposal. The oil-less twin-cylinder compressor means no crankcase oil to contaminate recovered refrigerant, and it handles vapour, liquid and push-pull recovery with a high-pressure cut-out at 550 psi. Rated for R-22, R-410A, R-134a, R-404A, R-407C and other common HFC and HCFC refrigerants; it is not rated for A2L flammable refrigerants such as R-32 or R-454B, which require a listed A2L machine. Recovery rate is roughly 0.5 lb per minute of vapour and up to 7 lb per minute in liquid push-pull. Includes a carry frame, dual gauges and a 1/4 in SAE inlet and outlet. Use only with a certified recovery cylinder and never fill past 80 percent.','{"Type":"Oil-less refrigerant recovery machine","Motor":"1 HP, 115V 60Hz","Compressor":"Twin-cylinder oil-less","Vapour Recovery Rate":"Approx 0.5 lb per minute","Liquid Push-Pull Rate":"Up to 7 lb per minute","High Pressure Cut-Out":"550 psi","Approved Refrigerants":"HFC and HCFC including R-410A, R-22, R-134a, R-404A","Not Rated For":"A2L flammable refrigerants","Connections":"1/4 in SAE inlet and outlet"}','["Recovery machine","Dual pressure gauges","Carry frame","Operating manual"]','["EPA-compliant recovery","System decommissioning","Component replacement","Cylinder transfer"]','Hardware > Tools','new','in_stock',40,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-RE-REC-1HP.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-RE-REC-1HP.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-RE-REC-1HP-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro 50 lb DOT Refrigerant Recovery Cylinder','TL-RE-CYL-50','TL-RE-CYL-50','AlperPro','accessory','recovery',149.00,'A 50 lb DOT-4BA400 recovery cylinder with a Y-valve giving separate liquid and vapour ports, which is what makes push-pull recovery and clean cylinder transfer possible. The tare weight is stamped on the collar so a technician can calculate the 80 percent fill limit precisely rather than guessing, and the grey body with yellow shoulder follows the industry convention for recovered refrigerant. Interior is treated to resist moisture and the float switch port accepts an 80 percent shut-off sensor. Cylinders are hydrostatically tested and date-stamped at manufacture; requalification is required every five years under DOT rules. Shipped empty. This is regulated hazardous-materials hardware sold to certified technicians and licensed shops only; recovered refrigerant must never be vented and cylinders must not be overfilled or exposed above 125 F.','{"Type":"DOT recovery cylinder","Specification":"DOT-4BA400","Capacity":"50 lb refrigerant (fill to 80 percent max)","Service Pressure":"400 psi","Valve":"Y-valve, liquid and vapour ports","Float Switch Port":"Yes, accepts 80 percent shut-off","Finish":"Grey body, yellow shoulder","Condition":"New, shipped empty"}','["50 lb recovery cylinder","Y-valve with liquid and vapour ports","Valve cap"]','["Refrigerant recovery","Cylinder transfer","Reclaim programs","Service fleet stock"]','Hardware > Tools','new','in_stock',90,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-RE-CYL-50.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-RE-CYL-50.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-RE-CYL-50-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro Digital Refrigerant Charging Scale 220 lb','TL-TO-SCALE-220','TL-TO-SCALE-220','AlperPro','accessory','tools',119.00,'A 220 lb capacity refrigerant scale with 0.5 oz resolution, the tool that turns charging from guesswork into a weighed procedure. Mini-splits in particular must be charged by weight against the nameplate figure plus a line-length allowance, and this scale resolves finely enough to hit that number on a small system. The platform is cast aluminium with a rubberised cylinder rest, and the detachable display sits on a magnetic bracket so it can be read at eye level while the cylinder stays on the floor. Functions include tare, unit switching between pounds, ounces and kilograms, hold and low-battery indication. The hinged case protects the load cell in a truck bed, which is where most scales are damaged. Powered by a 9V battery. Case and pallet pricing available to distributors.','{"Type":"Digital refrigerant charging scale","Capacity":"220 lb / 100 kg","Resolution":"0.5 oz / 10 g","Platform":"Cast aluminium with cylinder rest","Display":"Detachable with magnetic bracket","Functions":"Tare, hold, lb / oz / kg switching","Power":"9V battery","Case":"Hinged protective case included"}','["Charging scale","Detachable display and bracket","9V battery","Hinged carry case"]','["Weighed charging","Mini-split commissioning","Recovery weight tracking","Cylinder inventory"]','Hardware > Tools','new','in_stock',110,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-SCALE-220.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-SCALE-220.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-SCALE-220-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro Heated Diaphragm Electronic Refrigerant Leak Detector','TL-TO-LEAK-HD','TL-TO-LEAK-HD','AlperPro','accessory','tools',129.00,'A heated-diaphragm leak detector that responds to halogenated refrigerants at a sensitivity of about 0.14 oz per year, sensitive enough to find the slow seepage that shows up as a system losing charge over a season. Heated-diaphragm sensing is the preferred technology for service work because it ignores most shop contaminants such as oil mist and solvent vapour that trigger false alarms on cheaper corona-discharge detectors. Three sensitivity levels and both audible and visual indication let a technician zero out background concentration and then close in on the actual point of loss. The 15 in flexible stainless probe reaches behind coils and into evaporator cabinets. Detects R-410A, R-32, R-454B, R-134a, R-22, R-404A and other halogenated refrigerants. Ships with a spare sensor, batteries and a moulded case.','{"Type":"Heated diaphragm electronic leak detector","Sensitivity":"Approx 0.14 oz per year (4 g per year)","Sensitivity Levels":"3, with auto background zeroing","Detects":"R-410A, R-32, R-454B, R-134a, R-22, R-404A and other halogenated refrigerants","Probe":"15 in flexible stainless steel","Indication":"Audible and visual","Power":"Alkaline batteries","Sensor Life":"Approx 100 hours, replaceable"}','["Leak detector","Spare sensor","Batteries","Moulded carry case"]','["Leak location","Warranty diagnosis","Preventive maintenance","Refrigerant loss investigation"]','Hardware > Tools','new','in_stock',100,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-LEAK-HD.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-LEAK-HD.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-LEAK-HD-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro HVAC Digital Clamp Meter with Temperature Probes','TL-TO-CLAMP-600','TL-TO-CLAMP-600','AlperPro','accessory','tools',79.00,'A true-RMS clamp meter specified for HVAC work rather than general electrical: 600 A AC current, 600 V AC and DC, capacitance to 4000 microfarads for testing run and start capacitors, microamps for flame-rectification checks on gas equipment, and two type-K temperature inputs for measuring air or line temperature split. True-RMS matters on inverter-driven equipment where a mean-averaging meter misreads the distorted waveform. The 30 mm jaw closes around typical compressor and contactor conductors, and non-contact voltage detection gives a quick live-circuit check before the leads come out. The backlit display with hold and min/max makes readings possible inside a dark air handler. Includes silicone test leads, two bead thermocouples, batteries and a soft case. CAT III 600 V rated.','{"Type":"True-RMS HVAC clamp meter","AC Current":"600 A, 30 mm jaw","Voltage":"600 V AC and DC","Capacitance":"Up to 4000 microfarads","Microamps":"Yes, for flame rectification","Temperature":"2 x type-K thermocouple inputs","Extras":"Non-contact voltage detection, hold, min/max, backlight","Safety Rating":"CAT III 600 V"}','["Clamp meter","Silicone test leads","2 bead thermocouples","Batteries","Soft case"]','["Electrical diagnosis","Capacitor testing","Temperature split measurement","Furnace flame rectification","Motor amp draw"]','Hardware > Tools > Measuring Tools & Sensors','new','in_stock',130,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-CLAMP-600.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-CLAMP-600.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-CLAMP-600-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro Copper Tubing Tool Kit Flaring Swaging and Cutter','TL-TO-TUBE-KIT','TL-TO-TUBE-KIT','AlperPro','accessory','tools',69.00,'The hand-tool set that decides whether a mini-split installation holds vacuum. It contains an eccentric-cone 45 degree flaring tool sized for 1/4, 5/16, 3/8, 1/2, 5/8 and 3/4 in soft copper, a ratcheting tube cutter with a spare wheel, a deburring reamer, five swaging adapters and a spring bender set. The eccentric cone is the important part: it forms a smooth, work-hardened flare face that seals against a torqued flare nut, where a straight-yoke tool leaves ridges that weep refrigerant months later. Cutting square and reaming the burr before flaring prevents chips entering the circuit. All tools are hardened steel with a blow-moulded case that keeps the sizes in order on a truck. Sold in single kits and in case quantities for training programs and install crews.','{"Type":"Copper tubing tool kit","Flaring":"45 degree eccentric cone, 1/4 to 3/4 in","Tube Cutter":"Ratcheting, with spare cutting wheel","Swaging":"5 adapter sizes","Bending":"Spring benders included","Reamer":"Inside and outside deburring tool","Material":"Hardened steel","Case":"Blow-moulded"}','["Eccentric cone flaring tool","Ratcheting tube cutter and spare wheel","5 swaging adapters","Spring bender set","Deburring reamer","Blow-moulded case"]','["Mini-split installation","Line set fabrication","Flare joint repair","Training programs"]','Hardware > Tools','new','in_stock',150,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-TUBE-KIT.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-TUBE-KIT.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-TO-TUBE-KIT-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro Brass Quick-Coupler and Adapter Kit 14 Piece','TL-FI-ADAPT-14','TL-FI-ADAPT-14','AlperPro','accessory','fittings',44.00,'A fourteen-piece brass fitting kit that solves the connection problems that stop a service call: 1/4 in SAE to 5/16 in R-410A adapters, straight and 45 and 90 degree ball-valve couplers, tank adapters for both left-hand and right-hand thread cylinders, and blanking caps with captive gaskets. Every body is machined brass with a Teflon-sealed core depressor rather than a rubber washer, so the fittings hold on 800 psi high-side pressure and do not blow out when a hose is charged. The ball-valve couplers let hoses be isolated and removed without dumping the hose charge to atmosphere, which is both a compliance point and a cost saving on expensive refrigerant. Packed in a labelled tin so the sizes stay identifiable. A standard restock item for service vans.','{"Type":"Brass fitting and coupler kit","Pieces":"14","Includes":"1/4 in SAE to 5/16 in R-410A adapters, 45 and 90 degree couplers, ball-valve couplers, tank adapters, blanking caps","Material":"Machined brass with Teflon-sealed cores","Working Pressure":"800 psi","Packaging":"Labelled storage tin"}','["14 brass fittings and couplers","Labelled storage tin","Spare gaskets"]','["Hose connection","R-410A service","Cylinder transfer","Van restock"]','Hardware > Plumbing > Plumbing Fixture Hardware & Parts','new','in_stock',160,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-FI-ADAPT-14.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-FI-ADAPT-14.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-FI-ADAPT-14-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro Refrigerant Handling Safety Kit Gloves and Face Shield','TL-SA-PPE-KIT','TL-SA-PPE-KIT','AlperPro','accessory','safety',54.00,'Personal protective equipment matched to refrigerant handling, where the hazard is not heat but rapid freezing: liquid refrigerant released to atmosphere flashes at well below freezing and causes cold burns on contact. The kit contains cryogenic-rated gauntlet gloves with a leather palm and insulated cuff that covers the forearm, an anti-fog polycarbonate face shield with adjustable ratchet headgear meeting ANSI Z87.1 impact requirements, splash-resistant safety goggles for tighter spaces, and hearing protection for recovery-machine and vacuum-pump work. All items pack into a labelled pouch that can live in the van rather than being scattered. Required on site under most employer safety programs when breaking into a pressurised circuit or filling a recovery cylinder. Sold to contractors, facilities teams and training providers in single and case quantities.','{"Type":"Refrigerant handling PPE kit","Gloves":"Cryogenic-rated gauntlet, leather palm, insulated forearm cuff","Face Shield":"Anti-fog polycarbonate, ratchet headgear, ANSI Z87.1","Goggles":"Splash-resistant, indirect vent","Hearing Protection":"Foam ear plugs, NRR 32","Packaging":"Labelled storage pouch"}','["Cryogenic gauntlet gloves","Face shield with headgear","Safety goggles","Hearing protection","Storage pouch"]','["Refrigerant charging","Recovery operations","Cylinder handling","Site safety compliance","Training"]','Business & Industrial > Work Safety Protective Gear','new','in_stock',140,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-SA-PPE-KIT.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-SA-PPE-KIT.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-SA-PPE-KIT-2.jpg"}'),
('AlperPro Valve Core Removal Tool Set with Ball Valve','TL-VA-CORE-SET','TL-VA-CORE-SET','AlperPro','accessory','valves',39.00,'A valve core removal tool lets a technician change a leaking Schrader core, or remove cores entirely for a faster evacuation, without recovering the whole system charge. The tool threads onto the service port, isolates with an integral ball valve, and a sealed hex shaft engages the core so it can be backed out under pressure and captured. Removing cores during evacuation is standard practice on long line sets because the core restricts flow enough to add an hour or more to reaching a deep vacuum. The set covers 1/4 in and 5/16 in ports, includes a side 1/4 in SAE access port for connecting a hose while the tool is fitted, and comes with a pack of replacement cores in both standard and R-410A high-pressure specification, plus spare O-rings. Machined brass body rated to 800 psi.','{"Type":"Valve core removal tool set","Port Sizes":"1/4 in and 5/16 in","Isolation":"Integral ball valve","Side Access Port":"1/4 in SAE","Working Pressure":"800 psi","Included Cores":"Standard and R-410A high-pressure","Material":"Machined brass with sealed hex shaft"}','["Core removal tool, 1/4 in","Core removal tool, 5/16 in","Replacement Schrader cores","Spare O-rings","Storage case"]','["Core replacement under pressure","Fast evacuation","Leak repair","Service port maintenance"]','Hardware > Plumbing > Plumbing Fixture Hardware & Parts','new','in_stock',170,false,false,'["Individual","5-Pack","10-Pack"]','https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-VA-CORE-SET.jpg','{"https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-VA-CORE-SET.jpg","https://nzyljjngxfkydjeoyefz.supabase.co/functions/v1/product-image/products/TL-VA-CORE-SET-2.jpg"}');